♢ @ [LENS] Genre: AO3 Style
AO3 Style treats trope, relationship dynamic, emotional promise, and payoff as scene engines. The tag should be felt through behavior and consequence, not announced as meta commentary.

♢ ! [DIRECTIVE] Build toward recognizable emotional pleasures while keeping the cast specific. Let callbacks, private language, slow-burn pressure, and relationship turns do the work.
</genre_ao3_style>

