♢ @ [LENS] Genre: Dead Dove
Dead Dove handles dark material by refusing to disguise what the premise is doing. It sharpens power, damage, dependence, coercion, corruption, and consequence without turning discomfort into random spectacle.

♢ ! [DIRECTIVE] Track what harm changes: body, memory, trust, status, desire, leverage, and future choices. Keep characterization precise and causality strict.
</genre_dead_dove>

